{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>(A Game made by one of the %&amp;#@!*$ that worked on The Binding of Isaac: Repentance and Creator of world-famous video game At Least There is \u010ceda \u010cedovi\u0107)</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Myths are 100% True</strong> is an absurd platformer that feels like X-files if it was made by 12 year olds in Windows Movie Maker. Go to strange locations in this bizarre world and look for its many myths and secrets. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Make money by taking photos of myths no man has ever taken before. Buy power-ups or cosmetics from a strange kind of man for your adventuring needs. The game combines platforming and combat in a way that allows fast and smooth flow of gameplay.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3047510/extras/dae65128edef094ec442b908f06a3d92.poster.avif?t=1756940922\" width=600 height=168 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3047510/extras/dae65128edef094ec442b908f06a3d92.webm?t=1756940922\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3047510/extras/dae65128edef094ec442b908f06a3d92.mp4?t=1756940922\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Play as Hlev Pekarovic -</strong> a newly hired Photoslav and master of Aggressive Photography. He works for Teorija Tortino, one of the CEOs of Big Myth Company. Only with his skills can he create the world\u2019s biggest documentation of myths and legends!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3047510/extras/735f350031b89c8c63ae8e730e7b3af8.poster.avif?t=1756940922\" width=600 height=168 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3047510/extras/735f350031b89c8c63ae8e730e7b3af8.webm?t=1756940922\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3047510/extras/735f350031b89c8c63ae8e730e7b3af8.mp4?t=1756940922\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Play at whatever pace you wish.</strong> Get bonus money for going fast or play more thoroughly and make more money from your myth photos. You can do both too if you\u2019re insane enough.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3047510/extras/6c2f8a16fdcf277b6c79e45e4a19ac37.poster.avif?t=1756940922\" width=600 height=168 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3047510/extras/6c2f8a16fdcf277b6c79e45e4a19ac37.webm?t=1756940922\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3047510/extras/6c2f8a16fdcf277b6c79e45e4a19ac37.mp4?t=1756940922\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>This game is Inspired</strong> by not only some really cool games, but many obscure and strange videos from the 2000s; primarily GTA Myth and Legends videos from, like, 2008. As well, It takes inspiration from bits and pieces of other games, like demoknight trimping.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Play the Demo!</strong> That\u2019s Right! Try the First (of six) Chapter of this Baffling Experience! You can even leave a review for it on its own page, if you're brave enough.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3047510?t=1756940922","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3047510/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1756940922","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3047510/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1756940922","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3047510/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1756940922","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","demos":[{"appid":3060260,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>(A Game made by one of the %&amp;#@!*$ that worked on The Binding of Isaac: Repentance and Creator of world-famous video game At Least There is \u010ceda \u010cedovi\u0107)</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Myths are 100% True</strong> is an absurd platformer that feels like X-files if it was made by 12 year olds in Windows Movie Maker. Go to strange locations in this bizarre world and look for its many myths and secrets. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Make money by taking photos of myths no man has ever taken before. Buy power-ups or cosmetics from a strange kind of man for your adventuring needs. The game combines platforming and combat in a way that allows fast and smooth flow of gameplay.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3047510/extras/dae65128edef094ec442b908f06a3d92.poster.avif?t=1756940922\" width=600 height=168 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3047510/extras/dae65128edef094ec442b908f06a3d92.webm?t=1756940922\" type=\"video/webm;