8a16fdcf277b6c79e45e4a19ac37.mp4?t=1756940922\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>This game is Inspired</strong> by not only some really cool games, but many obscure and strange videos from the 2000s; primarily GTA Myth and Legends videos from, like, 2008. As well, It takes inspiration from bits and pieces of other games, like demoknight trimping.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Play the Demo!</strong> That\u2019s Right! Try the First (of six) Chapter of this Baffling Experience! You can even leave a review for it on its own page, if you're brave enough.</p>","developers":["LeatherIceCream","ClayGod"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3047510/header.jpg?t=1756940922","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"highlight":true,"id":257192186,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257192186/movie480.mp4?t=1756823654","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257192186/movie_max.mp4?t=1756823654"},"name":"Release Date Trailer","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257192186/83a77c7426080098cbba314180cb84a302122aca/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1756823654","webm":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257192186/movie480_vp9.webm?t=1756823654","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257192186/movie_max_vp9.webm?t=1756823654"}},{"highlight":false,"id":257034650,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257034650/movie480.mp4?t=1719968370","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257034650/movie_max.mp4?t=1719968370"},"name":"Very Important","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257034650/movie.293x165.jpg?t=1719968370","webm":{"480":"http://video.akama